Description: 4k intro by Faemiyah, released at Assembly 2007
 Organica is a 4k intro by the Finnish demogroup Faemiyah, released at
 Assembly 2007 where it ranked 9th in the 4k intro competition.
 .
 This package is built from the upstream sources, ported to SDL2.
